    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Poitete\"\nsubtitle: \"Permanent plot · Kolombangara, Solomon Islands\"\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"htmlwidget-396074f5a7bce3ef69bd\" style=\"width:100%;height:367px;\" class=\"leaflet html-widget\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-396074f5a7bce3ef69bd\">{\"x\":{\"options\":{\"minZoom\":3,\"crs\":{\"crsClass\":\"L.CRS.EPSG3857\",\"code\":null,\"proj4def\":null,\"projectedBounds\":null,\"options\":{}}},\"calls\":[{\"method\":\"addProviderTiles\",\"args\":[\"Esri.WorldGrayCanvas\",null,\"Map\",{\"errorTileUrl\":\"\",\"noWrap\":false,\"detectRetina\":false}]},{\"method\":\"addProviderTiles\",\"args\":[\"Esri.WorldImagery\",null,\"Satellite\",{\"errorTileUrl\":\"\",\"noWrap\":false,\"detectRetina\":false}]},{\"method\":\"addCircleMarkers\",\"args\":[[-20.727398,-22.10677311,-21.6119184,-19.385234,-7.88488,-18.077995],[167.090406,166.68812588,165.7468984,169.294602,157.127126,178.430887],7,null,null,{\"interactive\":true,\"className\":\"\",\"stroke\":true,\"color\":\"#16262B\",\"weight\":1,\"opacity\":0.5,\"fill\":true,\"fillColor\":\"#C98A1B\",\"fillOpacity\":0.6},null,null,[\"<b>Siloam<\\/b><br>Lifou, New Caledonia<br><a href='../plots/siloam.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>Blue River Provincial Park<\\/b><br>Grande Terre, New Caledonia<br><a href='../plots/blue-river.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>Great Ferns Provincial Park<\\/b><br>Grande Terre, New Caledonia<br><a href='../plots/great-ferns.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>Nusumetu<\\/b><br>Tanna, Vanuatu<br><a href='../plots/nusumetu.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>Poitete<\\/b><br>Kolombangara, Solomon Islands<br><a href='../plots/poitete.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>Vago<\\/b><br>Viti Levu, Fiji<br><a href='../plots/vago.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\"],null,null,{\"interactive\":false,\"permanent\":false,\"direction\":\"auto\",\"opacity\":1,\"offset\":[0,0],\"textsize\":\"10px\",\"textOnly\":false,\"className\":